confd (0.1.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Go-based NETCONF server backed by sysrepo.
  * Includes libyang v5.8.6, sysrepo v5.1.0, and Telekom sysrepo-plugins.
  * Interactive CLI shell with YAML config rendering.
  * Auto-connect to local server at launch.

